&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQLxc4FKHKPMmMwHTTeZ2TZyGWLCos8F2PzhQ9Hx3GFzA&oe=6B032EE4"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 3.png", "id": "1517280293482858", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_1517280296816191_3248062158835930793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FWm-rxP7EuwQ7kNvwGoMc_T&_nc_oc=AdpbsMbA8f5pMrvJ2gRH6uaZhav3FlGiQGhOLU2k6SVvKLUilmsxmUBkKER0nYIa8OM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRGzdrU1Ldr6Ct7LpFuq1wfwo3NFJBvcnuJKSj6GYrdrQ&oe=6B03064D"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 4.png", "id": "2180576715838619", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620985_2180576719171952_4179132521064836612_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BHJ3bFb5SvIQ7kNvwE-_5_p&_nc_oc=AdoMEoq1d_E_I2u2bTj4nF5vkFvc3Vxw_iAvw20yujdC6eWBDLpUS4GcUMuoNCHEuws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRru85PZIIbEjgzHhOJY6V9_RPMU4YZ_g2pkcD57FEtig&oe=6B030F26"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 5.png", "id": "1342847194692771", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622162_1342847198026104_6158502527951782000_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yDplmzz6-i4Q7kNvwFY9rzZ&_nc_oc=AdqD_pyyOFP5HyMhM-CSiSt5DY_O8gtKIae8lTtXIPwXk2uFR2geL6KFStndYrBqI5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJHEeAwggpYx0qc2x3MclMy3t1cKewb92VyD2Y3ntKYg&oe=6B032011"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "hvac personal thumbnail.png", "id": "1365445488881358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1365445492214691_7647014581930130160_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5g2FPcWXN94Q7kNvwHmqbpP&_nc_oc=AdrihS5VXo75ldzn1yfn-YYFlqyHb0ibmfh0P9cHu2thyrz6E0It0dkuu8BxczTbb4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmQVWMJQ6NU0Q-6_KZj1kCFlPOxioBwX0vO3Lr3DqhYw&oe=6B030E34"}, "display_name": "Skillveri HVAC Simulator-Personal Use", "keywords": ["skillveri", "hvac", "simulator", "cte", "vr"], "long_description": "The simulation technology that powers workforce training in the world\u2019s leading industries, now in a personal use version for individuals!\nStep into a fully immersive HVAC training environment with Skillveri HVAC Simulator - Personal Use edition.\n\nForget watching videos - start doing. Using Skillveri\u2019s advanced hand-tracking technology, you can perform all actions naturally with your hands, just as you would in the field - no controllers needed!\n\nThe realistic VR simulation for aspiring HVAC techs, this Personal version offers you hands-on practice anytime, anywhere.\n\nImmerse yourself in a realistic scenario and navigate complex tasks with ease using visual cues and step by step instructions.\n\nThis Personal version contains:\n- Commercial HVAC Cleaning and Maintenance\n- Residential HVAC Leak Testing\n\nReady to scale your training or adopt it for your institution? For our fully-loaded Enterprise version, perfect for schools and training institutions, contact us at usa@skillveri.com. Skillveri simulators are used across 100+ schools and colleges across the USA in their CTE programs.", "short_description": "Master HVAC skills in immersive VR - no risk, no tools, no wastage. Perform all actions with your hands exactly as in real life - no VR controllers needed! Perfect for building real-world confidence before stepping onto a job site.\n\nIn this Personal Use edition, learn Commercial HVAC cleaning & Residential HVAC leak testing inside realistic 3D environments. Hands-on practice - anytime, anywhere, at your own pace.\n\nWrite to usa@skillveri.com for the Enterprise version for schools or institutions."}]}, "developer_name": "Skillveri Inc", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skillveri.com/kelvin-lite-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_u